  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen clicking on someones profile in the Main Menu you can see their World Favorite Lists. The name on those lists starts on the left side at the same distance to the edge of the menu as the Worlds in said list.  \n\nThis is not the case when looking at your own profile however, there your favorite lists will have a lot of empty space on the side that shouldn't be there.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nThey should have the same distance to the side as the worlds them self do. or IIRC you should add back the indicator for who can see said list that was there before.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere are pictures showcasing the issue:",
